# The build context only needs: Dockerfile, firness/, tsffs/, uefi_asan/, Harness/, scripts/.
# Everything else -- notably the ~1 GB of edk2/FSP sources under eval_source/ -- is
# bind-mounted at runtime (`docker run -v ./eval_source/:/input`), so shipping it to the
# daemon just makes every build slower. Without this file the context is ~3.6 GB.
eval_source/
.git/
**/.git/
tsffs/target/
FuzzUEr_Overview.png
**/__pycache__/
qemu/build/
qemu/.git/
